flowchart TD
    Start([Start])
    OpenPage[User opens registration page]
    InputData[User enters name, phone number, password, and transaction PIN]
    Submit[User submits registration form]

    Validate{Are all input fields valid?}
    ErrorInput[Display input validation error]

    CheckPhone[System checks phone number availability]
    PhoneExists{Is phone number already registered?}
    ErrorPhone[Display phone number already registered]

    HashPassword[System hashes password and transaction PIN]

    BeginTransaction[Begin database transaction]
    CreateUser[System creates user account]
    CreateWallet[System creates wallet with ACTIVE status and IDR 0 balance]
    SaveData[(Save user and wallet data)]
    Commit[Commit database transaction]

    Success[Display registration success]

    Rollback[Rollback database transaction]
    ErrorSystem[Display registration failure message]

    End([End])

    Start --> OpenPage
    OpenPage --> InputData
    InputData --> Submit
    Submit --> Validate

    Validate -- No --> ErrorInput
    ErrorInput --> InputData

    Validate -- Yes --> CheckPhone
    CheckPhone --> PhoneExists

    PhoneExists -- Yes --> ErrorPhone
    ErrorPhone --> InputData

    PhoneExists -- No --> HashPassword
    HashPassword --> BeginTransaction
    BeginTransaction --> CreateUser
    CreateUser --> CreateWallet
    CreateWallet --> SaveData
    SaveData --> Commit
    Commit --> Success
    Success --> End

    CreateUser -. Database error .-> Rollback
    CreateWallet -. Database error .-> Rollback
    SaveData -. Database error .-> Rollback
    Rollback --> ErrorSystem
    ErrorSystem --> End